# Allowlist: the image gets ONLY the engine, the built front end and the hash-locked dependency list.
# Everything else stays out by default: .env, .venv, data/ (base, replay, logs), privy/ (node_modules = 1.2 GB), sign/ (sources + tests),
# web-src/, tools/, deploy/, run.sh.
*
!engine/
!web/
!requirements-lock.txt
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.map
**/node_modules
